{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B — model  \n`Qwen3_5MoeForCausalLM` (`qwen3_5_moe_text`): the Qwen3.5 hybrid design scaled to **2446.18B** stored parameters, text only. One continuous stack L0–91, read top → bottom; layers that repeat are drawn once with **×N**. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel); **boxes = operations**. T = sequence length. *Layer* tab = one layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Layer rows — **Gated DeltaNet** (69 layers, linear attention, fixed-size state) · **gated attention** (23 layers, every 4th, softmax + KV cache). Every layer then runs the same MoE: router picks **10 of 512** experts (SwiGLU, 2048 wide) plus 1 always-on **shared expert**.    \nLayer ≈ **26.26B** (DeltaNet) / **26.24B** (attention), 98% of it routed experts. All weights BF16. Context 262 144 tokens."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "tok2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -864,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**tokenizer** (vocab 248 320)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ids3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 130,
   "y": -768,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
