   "text": "L90"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-gdn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1400,
   "y": -524,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 250,
   "text": "**Gated DeltaNet rows** (69): linear attention. Each layer keeps one recurrent state [128 heads × 128 × 128] = 2 097 152 values, the same size at token 10 or token 262 144 — no KV cache that grows with T. Short causal conv (kernel 4) on q/k/v, per-head decay and write strength (β)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-full",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -524,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "**Gated attention rows** (23, L3, L7, …): softmax attention, GQA 64 query : 4 KV heads × 256, a sigmoid output gate per channel, RoPE on 64 of 256 dims. Only these layers cache K/V: 2 048 values per token each."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-moe",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 540,
   "y": -374,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "**MoE in every layer**: softmax router over 512 experts → top-10, weights renormalised. Expert = SwiGLU 8192→2048→8192 (50.3M). Shared expert (same width) is added through a sigmoid gate. Per token: 10 + 1 experts of 512 → ~2.1% of FFN weights."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-norm",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1040,
   "y": -374,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "Pre-norm residual blocks; RMSNorm is zero-centred (scale = 1 + w). q/k get their own per-head RMSNorm in the attention layers."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-scale",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1540,
   "y": -374,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**Same recipe as Qwen3.5-397B-A17B**, scaled: 92 layers × 8192 wide (vs 60 × 4096), 64 q / 4 kv heads, 128 DeltaNet value heads; the MoE shape (512 experts, top-10, 2048 wide) is unchanged. No vision tower ships in this repo."
  },
  {
   "id": "ho8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -178,
   "y": -30,
   "width": 655,
   "height": 9,
