  },
  {
   "id": "note-mtp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1900,
   "y": 612,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "Multi-token prediction head (26.38B, 1 layer, its own full 512-expert MoE). `mtp_use_dedicated_embeddings: false` — it reuses the main embed table and lm head (no copies in the checkpoint). Serving engines run it as a draft for speculative decoding (the card: MTP trained with multiple steps); the main model verifies. Wiring per vLLM qwen3_5_mtp.py."
  },
  {
